@startuml
!include ../drawio-theme.puml

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 90
top to bottom direction

title Agent Kernel System C4 层间边界协议（Local-first 候选）

node "本机 Client / Desktop Host" as External #FFF8F0 {
  [CLI / Desktop Host] as Gateway
}

rectangle "Agent Kernel System 边界" as Kernel #FFFDF8 {
  package "Protocol Boundary" as ProtocolBoundary #FFF8F0 {
    [AgentKernelProtocolFacade] as ProtocolFacade
  }

  package "L1 Control & Orchestration" as L1 #EAF2F8 {
    [AgentSystemGateway] as SystemGateway
    [RunScheduler / Session / PEP] as Control
  }

  package "L2 Cognitive Runtime" as L2 #FEF9E7 {
    [AgentRuntime / AgentLoop] as Runtime
  }

  package "Security Plane" as Security #FDEDEC {
    [PermissionSystem / PDP] as PDP
  }

  package "L3 Controlled Tool Runtime" as L3 #E9F7EF {
    [ToolRuntime / Tool Router] as Tools
  }
  package "L4 受控执行边界" as L4 #E5E7EB {
    [ToolProviderAdapter / SandboxRuntime] as Sandbox
  }
}

database "Local Memory Store" as Memory #E9F7EF
cloud "Model Provider" as Model #FEF9E7

package "Operations Plane" as Ops #F3E8FF {
  [Local Log / Trace / Metrics / Audit] as Telemetry
}

package "Infrastructure Plane" as Infra #E5E7EB {
  [Storage / Artifact / Secret / Clock / Transport Adapter] as Adapters
}

Gateway -right-> ProtocolFacade : BND-EXT-001\nAgentKernelProtocolV1
ProtocolFacade -right-> SystemGateway : AgentSystemGateway
SystemGateway -right-> Control : BND-L1-001
Control -down-> Runtime : BND-L12-001
Control -right-> PDP : BND-SEC-001
Control -right-> Tools : BND-L13-001
Tools -right-> Sandbox : BND-L34-001\nL34-SPEC-1.0.0
Runtime -down-> Memory : BND-MEM-001
Runtime -down-> Model : BND-MOD-001

Control .down.> Telemetry : BND-OPS-001
Runtime .down.> Telemetry
Tools .down.> Telemetry

Control --> Adapters : BND-INF-001
Runtime --> Adapters
Tools --> Adapters

note bottom of L4
  L1 不得直接调用 L4。
  所有沙箱动作先形成 ToolCall，经过 PEP/PDP 与 Permit，
  再由 L3 ToolRuntime 通过 SandboxPort 执行并自动回收。
end note

note bottom of ProtocolFacade
  薄协议外观：版本、Schema、DTO、错误和事件映射。
  不拥有调度、权限、持久化、重试与恢复；
  In-process / JSONL / HTTP Adapter 不得绕过 Gateway。
end note

legend bottom
  |= 边界 |= 首版 Local-first 绑定 |
  | BND-EXT-001 | AgentKernelProtocolV1：CLI 进程内；Desktop Host 使用 stdio JSONL；HTTP 可选 |
  | BND-L1-001 | 强类型 Port + 本地有界队列 + SQLite 事务 |
  | BND-L12-001 | 进程内调用；隔离 Pi Runtime 时使用 stdio JSONL |
  | BND-SEC-001 | 进程内 PermissionDecisionPort / PermitValidationPort |
  | BND-L13-001 | 进程内 ToolRuntimePort |
  | BND-L34-001 | P1受信Port；P2同机受信Supervisor JSONL 1.0，工作负载独立管道 |
  | BND-MEM-001 | 进程内 Port + 本地 SQLite/Artifact Adapter |
  | BND-MOD-001 | Adapter 私有 HTTPS / SSE / SDK |
  | BND-OPS-001 | 本地结构化日志、Trace ID、指标快照和 SQLite 审计；OTLP 可选 |
  | BND-INF-001 | 代码级 Infrastructure Port + Scoped Adapter |
  gRPC、Temporal、Event Bus、MicroVM/Vsock 与跨主机 mTLS 均为后续部署档案。
  Port 定义稳定语义；详细接口、触发条件与故障语义见边界协议文档。
endlegend

@enduml
